<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-28T23:22:54.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:22:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has conducted airstrikes in southern Syria targeting Islamic State militants, while Syrian authorities report civilian casualties and have condemned the raids as a breach of airspace. Syrian forces killed a French jihadist in a shootout in Harem and another French extremist in Idlib, and two Syrian defence ministry personnel were killed by unidentified gunmen in Idlib. Jordan and Syria have reopened a border crossing and agreed to a joint investigation, while Jordanian officials cite a security vacuum in the south. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/unacceptable-violation-syria-condemns-jordan-airstrikes&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNZHk1ZHJHQ25NTzFlTGZNY3VuY0ZoNFFIYlZyWS1BSTNYcW1kOWNwT2lqLUhCUHJaaUVzZzR3Qnl6a2FqYUppbHVvd0NJdmdEYTdMdTlGVjJ6XzQ5a3dieEs5cm9GdlMtajdLRGdyR3BsRnplS1RWcUNTTm8yelZCNnFnTElhU040ZDRqT194QVd3dWVz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Foundation for Defense of Democracies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPeE51LUQ1Mk9RTDFnRjVENFh3T3JXVUlsTGJmeS1QaFluV0s3SEhXQXhHODhGQWQwa04wWW1SWTg3VDNxWndEeDNmSjZlYmJfc201bW95TUhmX2RJQXpkRFZJUHhUSm1Ua0RoOHhSdWhHVUwzUEw4Z1Y5czFqVUFsTGpJalZSRzBZSkg3M1lGMm5GQWpVcTFsNlF5ZS1WTFl3bWpya3dJRmF2NmFQVWNQVFBjZ0pJRWNUOGprdUxzV3BGdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPczlodGVCcC16bGw1cW9vcjhFWlRyaWFkNUNjV3Bkb2pFTVRYbDUyNDRwUWdnekVpMThSRGdaVjZNLVd2MjZ4WGJZOXJTcVgySjVnZnVTNTZCbW1r